# LMS Portal Frontend — Development Rules

> Scaffold migrated from IOC (Internship OneConnect). Follow these conventions exactly — ESLint enforces most of them at commit time (`pnpm run lint:check` requires **0 warnings**).

## Golden Rules

1. **Thin routes** — `app/*/page.tsx` only wires layout + view + metadata
2. **All UI text** → `UI_TEXT` in `src/constants/ui-text.constants.ts` (NOT next-intl)
3. **No hex in JSX** — use Tailwind theme classes or `COLORS`/`ICON_COLORS` for JS/SVG
4. **Types in `src/types/`** — never in views, components, services, hooks, stores
5. **Zod in `src/schemas/`** — never inline in views/components
6. **API via `services/`** — never call `httpClient` directly from views/components
7. **pnpm only** — never use npm/yarn
8. **Reuse before create** — check `base/`, `application/`, existing hooks/utils first
9. **Mock data in `src/mocks/`** — never hardcode mock arrays/objects inline in views, components, or hooks; put them in `src/mocks/<feature>.mock.ts` (seed from `LMS_AI_SPEC/extracted-portal/logic.js` when building UI)
10. **UI parity with extracted-portal** — for basic-flow WPs (`docs/ui-implementation/work-packages/`), match `http://localhost:4178/template.html` (via `server.mjs`) at 100%; do not mix in `chi-tiet/` screens until `work-packages-supplemental/`

