## Tech Stack

| Layer | Choice |
|-------|--------|
| Framework | Next.js 16 App Router, TypeScript strict |
| UI | React 19, Server Components where possible |
| Styling | TailwindCSS v4 + tokens in `src/styles/theme.css` |
| Server state | TanStack React Query |
| Client UI state | Zustand (`src/stores/`) |
| Forms | React Hook Form + Zod (`@hookform/resolvers`) |
| HTTP | `fetch` via `src/lib/http-client.ts` (no axios) |
| Icons | `iconsax-react` wrappers in `src/components/icons/` |
| Monitoring | Sentry |
| Package manager | **pnpm** (`pnpm@10.12.1`) |

