## Project Structure

```
src/
├── app/                    # Next.js routes — thin layer only
├── views/                  # Page compositions (*-view.tsx)
├── components/
│   ├── base/               # Primitives: Button, Input, Select, Badge…
│   ├── application/        # Composites: Table, DatePicker, Pagination, Modal…
│   ├── ui/                 # Feature UI (e.g. ui/auth/, ui/courses/)
│   ├── layout/             # PublicLayout, header, sidebar, footer
│   ├── auth/               # PermissionGuard, ProtectedRoute
│   ├── common/             # Cross-feature helpers (loading-overlay…)
│   ├── foundations/        # SVG icons (payment-icons…)
│   └── icons/              # iconsax icon exports
├── constants/              # UI_TEXT, API_ENDPOINTS, UPPER_CASE values
├── config/                 # navigation, permissions, toast, payment
├── hooks/                  # use-*.ts custom hooks
├── lib/                    # http-client, query-keys, filter-url-params
├── providers/              # AppProviders, QueryProvider, ToastProvider
├── schemas/                # Zod schemas + inferred form types
├── services/               # *.service.ts API calls
├── stores/                 # Zustand stores
├── styles/                 # theme.css, globals.css, typography.css
├── types/                  # All TS interfaces/types/enums for features
├── mocks/                  # UI/dev mock data only (*.mock.ts) — not in views/components
└── utils/                  # Pure helper functions
```

