## Architecture & Import Boundaries

**Data flow (one direction only):**

```
app/page.tsx → views/*-view.tsx → components → hooks → services → lib
```

**Who can import whom (ESLint `boundaries/element-types`):**

| From | Can import |
|------|------------|
| `app` | views, components, hooks, services, shared*, constants, config, utils, mocks |
| `views` | components, hooks, services, shared*, constants, config, utils, mocks |
| `components` | components, hooks, services, shared*, constants, config, utils |
| `hooks` | hooks, services, shared*, constants, config, utils, mocks |
| `services` | services, shared*, constants, config, utils, mocks |
| `utils` | shared*, constants, config, utils |
| `config` | shared*, constants, config |
| `constants` | shared*, constants |
| `mocks` | shared*, constants, mocks |

*`shared` = `types/`, `lib/`, `providers/`, `stores/`, `styles/`

**Forbidden:**
- `services` → `components` or `views`
- `constants` → `services` or `hooks`
- `views` → `app`
- Direct `fetch`/`httpClient` in views or components
- Mock datasets defined inside views/components (use `src/mocks/` instead)
- `components` → `mocks` (prefer hooks/views to load mock data and pass props)

---

## Component Tier — Where to Put Code

| Tier | Folder | Use when |
|------|--------|----------|
| **Base** | `components/base/` | Single-purpose UI atom (Button, Input, Checkbox). No business logic. |
| **Application** | `components/application/` | Reusable composite widget used across features (Table, DatePicker, Stepper). |
| **Feature UI** | `components/ui/<feature>/` | Feature-specific forms, cards, panels (e.g. `ui/auth/login-form.tsx`). |
| **Layout** | `components/layout/` | Shells, header, sidebar, footer. |
| **View** | `views/` | One file per page; composes layout + feature UI. No API calls — delegate to hooks. |

**Decision tree:**
1. Exists in `base/` or `application/`? → Reuse it
2. Used on one feature only? → `components/ui/<feature>/`
3. Full page composition? → `views/<name>-view.tsx`
4. Need API data? → `hooks/use-<feature>.ts` + `services/<feature>.service.ts`

---

## File & Folder Naming

- **kebab-case** for all files/folders in `views/`, `components/`, `hooks/`, `services/`
- Views **must** end with `-view.tsx` (e.g. `courses-view.tsx`, `login-view.tsx`)
- **Flat only** — no subfolders under `src/views/` (use prefix if needed: `teacher-dashboard-view.tsx`, not `views/teacher/...`)
- Feature UI still nests under `components/ui/<feature>/`
- Services end with `.service.ts`
- Hooks start with `use-` (e.g. `use-courses.ts`)
- Types: `<feature>.types.ts` or `<component-area>.types.ts` in `src/types/`
- Schemas: `<feature>.schema.ts` in `src/schemas/`
- Constants: `<area>.constants.ts` in `src/constants/`

