## Adding a New Feature — Checklist

Example: "Courses management"

```
1. src/constants/ui-text.constants.ts     → UI_TEXT.courses.*
2. src/constants/api-endpoints.constants.ts → API_ENDPOINTS.COURSES.*
3. src/types/courses.types.ts             → Course, CourseListResponse…
4. src/schemas/courses.schema.ts          → createCourseSchema (if forms)
5. src/services/courses.service.ts        → getCourses(), createCourse()…
6. src/lib/query-keys.ts                  → queryKeys.courses.*
7. src/hooks/use-courses.ts               → useQuery/useMutation wrappers
8. src/components/ui/courses/             → course-table.tsx, course-form.tsx
9. src/views/courses-view.tsx             → page composition
10. src/app/courses/page.tsx              → metadata + layout + <CoursesView />
11. src/config/navigation.tsx             → nav item (use Route type + UI_TEXT)
```

