## UI_TEXT — All User-Facing Text

**File:** `src/constants/ui-text.constants.ts`
**Import:** `import { UI_TEXT } from "@/constants/ui-text.constants"`

### Structure convention

```typescript
export const UI_TEXT = {
  common: { save, cancel, delete, loading, genericError, pagination, datePicker… },
  home: { … },
  auth: { login: { … }, register: { … } },
  navigation: { … },
  layout: { … },
  metadata: { layout, home, login… },  // SEO titles/descriptions
  // New features:
  courses: { title, list, form, errors: { … } },
} as const;
```

### Key naming

- Feature root: `UI_TEXT.<feature>.<key>`
- Errors nested: `UI_TEXT.<feature>.errors.<errorKey>`
- Form labels: `UI_TEXT.<feature>.<field>Label`, `<field>Placeholder`
- Metadata/SEO: `UI_TEXT.metadata.<page>.title` / `.description`

### ESLint blocks (will fail lint:check)

- Any Vietnamese/English string in JSX text nodes
- Hardcoded `label`, `placeholder`, `title`, `description`, `hint`, `alt`
- Strings in object props (`columns`, `message`, `tooltip`, `empty`…)
- Toast messages as string literals
- Arbitrary Tailwind colors: `bg-[#BC2228]` → use `bg-brand-500`

### Correct patterns

```tsx
// JSX text
<Button>{UI_TEXT.common.save}</Button>

// Props
<Input label={UI_TEXT.auth.login.emailLabel} placeholder={UI_TEXT.auth.login.emailPlaceholder} />

// Metadata (app/page.tsx)
export const metadata: Metadata = {
  title: UI_TEXT.metadata.login.title,
  description: UI_TEXT.metadata.login.description,
};

// Navigation config
{ label: UI_TEXT.navigation.courses, href: "/courses" as Route }
```

