## Colors & Styling

### In JSX / className → Tailwind theme tokens

Design tokens live in `src/styles/theme.css`. Use semantic Tailwind classes:

| Purpose | Examples |
|---------|----------|
| Brand | `bg-brand-500`, `text-brand-600`, `border-brand-200` |
| Neutral | `text-slate-600`, `bg-slate-50`, `border-slate-200` |
| Semantic | `text-success-500`, `bg-error-50`, `text-warning-700` |
| Typography | `font-display` (headings), `font-sans` (body) |

**Never:** `#BC2228`, `rgb(188,34,40)`, `bg-[#...]`, inline `style={{ color: '...' }}`

### In JS / SVG / chart props → Constants

```typescript
import { ICON_COLORS, COLORS } from "@/constants/app.constants";
// COLORS is alias for ICON_COLORS

<Lock color={ICON_COLORS.GRAY_500} />
fill={ICON_COLORS.BRAND_500}
```

| Constant file | Use for |
|---------------|---------|
| `ICON_COLORS` / `COLORS` (`app.constants.ts`) | Icons, charts, dynamic JS colors |
| `BADGE_*_COLORS` (`badge.constants.ts`) | Badge component variants |
| `PAYMENT_COLORS` (`colors.constants.ts`) | Payment SVG icons |
| `theme.css` CSS variables | Source of truth for Tailwind tokens |

### Utility helper

```typescript
import { cx } from "@/utils/cx";           // conditional classes
import { cn } from "@/lib/utils";          // tailwind-merge wrapper
```

