## Constants Organization

| File | Contents |
|------|----------|
| `ui-text.constants.ts` | All display strings |
| `api-endpoints.constants.ts` | `API_ENDPOINTS`, `API_PREFIX` |
| `app.constants.ts` | `APP_CONFIG`, `ROUTES`, `ICON_COLORS`, `ICON_SIZES` |
| `http.constants.ts` | HTTP status codes |
| `*-components.constants.ts` | Component-specific numeric/size config |
| `password-validation.constants.ts` | Validation limits |

**Rules:**
- UPPER_CASE `const` only in `src/constants/` (not in views/components/utils)
- Constants files = static data only (no functions)
- Status codes, magic numbers → named constants (ESLint warns on magic numbers)

