## Types Organization

**All interfaces/types/enums** → `src/types/<feature>.types.ts`

```typescript
// src/types/courses.types.ts
export interface Course {
  id: string;
  title: string;
}

export interface CourseListResponse {
  items: Course[];
  total: number;
}
```

**Forbidden locations:** views, components, services, hooks, stores, providers

**Exception:** `z.infer<typeof schema>` type aliases live in `schemas/` alongside the schema.

---

## Schemas (Zod)

**File:** `src/schemas/<feature>.schema.ts`

```typescript
import { z } from "zod";
import { UI_TEXT } from "@/constants/ui-text.constants";

export const createCourseSchema = z.object({
  title: z.string().min(1, UI_TEXT.courses.errors.titleRequired),
});

export type CreateCourseFormData = z.infer<typeof createCourseSchema>;
```

- Validation messages **must** use `UI_TEXT`
- Shared validators → `src/utils/password-validation.ts` etc.
- Never define `z.object()` in views or components

