## Routing & Navigation

**Routes:** `src/constants/app.constants.ts` → `ROUTES`

```typescript
export const ROUTES = {
  HOME: "/",
  LOGIN: "/login",
  COURSES: "/courses",
} as const;
```

**Typed routes:** import `Route` from `next` for Link/nav href:

```typescript
import type { Route } from "next";
href={ROUTES.COURSES as Route}  // or literal "/courses" as Route
```

**Navigation config:** `src/config/navigation.tsx`

```typescript
import type { Route } from "next";
import { UI_TEXT } from "@/constants/ui-text.constants";

export const DASHBOARD_NAV_CONFIG: NavConfigItem[] = [
  { label: UI_TEXT.navigation.courses, href: "/courses" as Route },
];
```

