## Auth & Permissions

- Profile: `useAuth()` hook → `src/hooks/use-auth.ts`
- Permissions enum: `src/config/permissions.ts` → `PermissionCode`
- Route guard: `<ProtectedRoute>` / `<PermissionGuard>` in `components/auth/`
- Token key: `APP_CONFIG.ACCESS_TOKEN_KEY` (`lms_access_token`)
- Logout: `useLogout()` hook

```tsx
import { PermissionCode } from "@/config/permissions";
import { PermissionGuard } from "@/components/auth/permission-guard";

<PermissionGuard permission={PermissionCode.MANAGE_USERS}>
  <AdminPanel />
</PermissionGuard>
```

