## State Management

| Need | Solution |
|------|----------|
| API data, caching | React Query + `queryKeys` |
| Sidebar open/close | `useSidebarStore` (Zustand) |
| Modal notifications | `useNotificationStore` |
| Unsaved form warning | `useUnsavedChangesStore` |
| Ephemeral UI (tabs, filters in URL) | `useFilterWithParams`, `useTableStateWithParams` |

**Do not** put API response data in Zustand — use React Query.

---

## Server vs Client Components

| Server Component (default) | Client Component (`"use client"`) |
|---------------------------|-------------------------------------|
| `app/page.tsx` (metadata) | Forms, interactive UI |
| Static views without hooks | Anything using `useState`, `useEffect` |
| | React Query hooks, Zustand |
| | Event handlers, browser APIs |

Put `"use client"` at top of: forms, modals, interactive tables, layout with sidebar toggle.

