## Before Committing

```bash
pnpm run type-check    # must pass
pnpm run lint:check    # 0 errors, 0 warnings
pnpm run build         # verify production build (recommended)
```

**Self-check:**
- [ ] New text added to `UI_TEXT`
- [ ] New endpoints in `API_ENDPOINTS`
- [ ] New types in `src/types/`
- [ ] New schemas in `src/schemas/`
- [ ] Mock data in `src/mocks/` (not inline)
- [ ] Query keys in `src/lib/query-keys.ts`
- [ ] Files/folders are kebab-case
- [ ] Views end with `-view.tsx`
- [ ] No hex colors, no magic strings
- [ ] Basic-flow UI matches `localhost:4178/template.html` when applicable

